ass=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-304203 ac.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/32/Spine_static-304203_ac.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"415\" height=\"623\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"415\" data-file-height=\"623\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3042\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%88%B1%E5%AE%A0\" title=\"爱宠\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%88%B1%E5%AE%A0\" title=\"爱宠\"><img alt=\"爱宠\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-304201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-304201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/73/HeadIconSmall-304201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%88%B1%E5%AE%A0\" title=\"爱宠\">爱宠</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.7</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>1987宇宙漫步</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：304203</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">即使在太空，稻草人依旧找到了一份工作。<br />他需要待在马戏团里，驱赶那些前来偷窃食物的老鼠——这些生物大多是被人类的飞船带来的。老鼠们并不关心飞船会飞向什么地方，它们只知道食物储藏室里有美味的奶酪。<br />最初，这些老鼠很胆小，稻草人很容易地就能驱赶它们。到后来，老鼠们习惯了稻草人的存在，开始大张旗鼓地偷窃马戏团储存的奶酪——直到那个表演空中飞人的小女孩发现了它们。<br />不久之后，马戏团里增添了一项新的表演《聪明老鼠偷奶酪》。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304203\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2d/Belonging-304204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">何处飘来的红气球<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Red Balloon from Nowhere</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.6<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一只与受访者亦步亦趋的气球。<br />如果这枚气球跟随受访者够久，或许也会和他一样，浮现一枚表达善意的笑容。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/dd/Belonging-304205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">歪斜的领带<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Asymmetrical Tie</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2.2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者身上最为簇新的一部分。我们相信，即使受访者不具备良好的餐桌礼仪，也不会因进食而弄脏了这根领带。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5f/Belonging-304206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">稻草墩<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Hay Bale</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一个包裹着稻草的道具箱，装在其中的道具既不昂贵，也不特别。但只有这些道具得到了稻草人的看守。这引发了许多人的好奇，比如流窜的小偷，以及马戏团的道具师自己。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B01.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 深空环游记1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B01.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B01.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B01.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B01.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B01.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B01.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B02.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 深空环游记2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B02.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B02.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B02.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B02.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B02.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E7%8E%AF%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B02.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">深空环游记 <small style=\"color: grey\">Space Traveler</small></span></span>"}}